  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RWI Pilot Project Support 2025- 2027</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RWI Pilot Project Support 2025- 2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Raoul Wallenberg-institutet (RWI) kommer att genomf&#xf6;ra ett ett&#xe5;rigt pilotprojekt med fokus p&#xe5; f&#xf6;retagens h&#xe5;llbarhet och m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter i relation till den europeiska gr&#xf6;na given och handeln mellan EU och Turkiet. Projektet f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas &#xf6;ka medvetenheten bland turkiska myndigheter om den europeiska gr&#xf6;na given, med fokus p&#xe5; f&#xf6;retagens h&#xe5;llbarhet, due diligence och den sociala dimensionen av omst&#xe4;llningen. Det kommer ocks&#xe5; att &#xf6;ka kunskapen bland svenska f&#xf6;retag som &#xe4;r verksamma i Turkiet om due diligence avseende m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter och ESG-fr&#xe5;gor (milj&#xf6;, socialt ansvar och bolagsstyrning).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Raoul Wallenberg Institute (RWI) will implement a one-year pilot project focused on corporate sustainability and human rights in relation to the European Green Deal and EU&#x2013;T&#xfc;rkiye trade. The project is expected to increase awareness among Turkish authorities of the European Green Deal, with a focus on corporate sustainability, due diligence, and the social dimension of the transition. It will also enhance knowledge among Swedish companies operating in T&#xfc;rkiye regarding Human Rights Due Diligence and ESG (environmental, social, and governance) issues.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the proposed pilot is to enhance the awareness of key public institutions in T&#xfc;rkiye on the EGD, with a focus on corporate sustainability, due diligence, and the social dimensions of the green transition, contributing to alignment with EU frameworks and strengthening T&#xfc;rkiye&apos;s role in EU value chains. 
A second objective is to engage Swedish companies in T&#xfc;rkiye in support in their preparedness and compliance efforts.</narrative>
  </description>
